      "content": "That feeling of losing your former self is a profound kind of grief, and it's understandable that you feel hollowed out by that loss. The idea of an endless, empty loop is exhausting, but it doesn't have to be your permanent reality. Professional support can help you navigate this sense of self-loss and start building a new foundation, even when it feels impossible right now.",
      "source": "target",
